<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>{{ summary.headline }} — Abstract</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; margin: 2rem auto; max-width: 760px; line-height: 1.6; color: #1a1a1a; }
  .ai-warning { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; background: #fff4d6; border: 1px solid #e0b100; color: #6b4f00; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .meta { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #666; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
  h1 { font-size: 2rem; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0.25rem 0 1.25rem; }
  h2 { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 0.85rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: #555; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; padding-bottom: 0.25rem; margin: 1.75rem 0 0.75rem; }
  .nutshell { background: #f5f5f5; padding: 1rem 1.25rem; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 0; }
  ol.takeaways { padding-left: 1.4rem; margin: 0; }
  ol.takeaways li { margin: 0.5rem 0; }
  ul.gaps { padding-left: 1.2rem; margin: 0; }
  ul.gaps li { margin: 0.4rem 0; }
  .common { color: #555; font-style: italic; margin: 0; }
  .recommend { border-left: 5px solid #111; padding: 0.5rem 1rem; margin: 0; }
  .recommend p { margin: 0.25rem 0; }
  .stats { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #555; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
  details { border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.5rem 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; }
  .evidence { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0.5rem 0 0; }
  .evidence li { margin: 0.5rem 0; padding-left: 0.75rem; border-left: 3px solid #ccc; }
  .evidence li.challenger { border-color: #b83280; }
  .evidence li.champion { border-color: #2b6cb0; }
  .evidence .quote { display: block; font-style: italic; }
  .evidence .why { display: block; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #444; }
  .tag { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; display: inline-block; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 0.05rem 0.4rem; border-radius: 4px; margin-right: 0.4rem; color: #fff; background: #777; }
  .tag.challenger { background: #b83280; }
  .tag.champion { background: #2b6cb0; }
  .badge { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; display: inline-block; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; padding: 0.1rem 0.4rem; border-radius: 4px; margin-left: 0.4rem; background: #ffe0e0; color: #a30000; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="ai-warning">Warning: this abstract was generated by an LLM from an LLM-produced comparison and may contain errors. Verify against the source papers before acting on it.</div>

<p class="meta">Abstract · challenger vs. champion</p>
<h1>{{ summary.headline }}</h1>

<h2>In a nutshell</h2>
<p class="nutshell">{{ summary.governing_thought }}</p>
<p class="stats">{{ summary.counts.challenger_only }} assertions only in the challenger · {{ summary.counts.champion_only }} only in the champion · {{ summary.counts.shared }} shared</p>

<h2>Take-aways: what the challenger brings</h2>
<ol class="takeaways">
  {% for item in summary.challenger_brings %}
  <li>{{ item }}</li>
  {% endfor %}
</ol>

<h2>Watch out for: what the challenger lacks</h2>
{% if summary.challenger_lacks %}
<ul class="gaps">
  {% for item in summary.challenger_lacks %}
  <li>{{ item }}</li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
{% else %}
<p class="common">No material gaps identified.</p>
{% endif %}

<h2>Common ground</h2>
<p class="common">{{ summary.shared_ground }}</p>

<h2>Recommendation</h2>
<div class="recommend">
  <p>{{ summary.recommendation }}</p>
  <p><strong>Who should read the challenger:</strong> {{ summary.who_should_care }}</p>
</div>

<h2>Why we say this</h2>
{% for pillar in summary.pillars %}
<details>
  <summary>{{ loop.index }}. {{ pillar.claim }}</summary>
  <ul class="evidence">
    {% for item in pillar.evidence %}
    <li class="{{ item.source }}">
      <span class="tag {{ item.source }}">{{ item.source }}</span>{% if not item.grounded %}<span class="badge">quote not found in comparison</span>{% endif %}
      <span class="quote">“{{ item.quote }}”</span>
      <span class="why">{{ item.why_it_matters }}</span>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</details>
{% endfor %}
</body>
</html>
